%% Sequence Diagram for Youth Account Management API
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant UI as Parent Dashboard UI (React SPA)
    participant API as Youth Account API (Spring Boot)
    participant Auth as OAuth Service
    participant AccSvc as Account Service
    participant TxnSvc as Transaction Service
    participant PaySvc as Payment Service

    Parent->>UI: Login & access dashboard
    UI->>Auth: OAuth 2.0 Token Request
    Auth-->>UI: Access Token
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (access token)
    API->>Auth: Validate Token & RBAC
    Auth-->>API: Token valid
    API->>AccSvc: Fetch account data
    AccSvc-->>API: Account details
    API->>TxnSvc: Retrieve recent transactions
    TxnSvc-->>API: Transactions
    API-->>UI: Dashboard details
    UI-->>Parent: Render dashboard

    Parent->>UI: Initiate fund transfer
    UI->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    API->>Auth: Validate Token & RBAC
    Auth-->>API: Token valid
    API->>PaySvc: Initiate transfer
    PaySvc-->>API: Transfer status
    API->>AccSvc: Update balance
    AccSvc-->>API: Updated balance
    API-->>UI: Transfer response
    UI-->>Parent: Show transfer result

    Parent->>UI: Set spending limit
    UI->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    API->>Auth: Validate Token & RBAC
    Auth-->>API: Token valid
    API->>AccSvc: Update spending limit
    AccSvc-->>API: Limit updated
    API-->>UI: Limit response
    UI-->>Parent: Show limit update

    Parent->>UI: View transaction history
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
    API->>Auth: Validate Token & RBAC
    Auth-->>API: Token valid
    API->>TxnSvc: Fetch transactions
    TxnSvc-->>API: Transactions
    API-->>UI: Transaction history
    UI-->>Parent: Render history
